     },
     "said": [
      "## Trait–environment links To simultaneously analyze the relationships between assemblage composition, species traits, and environmental variables, we used the modiWed fourth-corner methodology (Dray and Legendre 2008).",
      "Because the physiological traits we measured are more appropriate to diurnal ants (nocturnal ants are less likely to be impacted by daytime conditions), we also analyzed the trait–environment relationship for the common species dataset weighted by diurnal activity."
     ],
